-- Reviewed construction boundaries: record fields and concrete products;
-- monic quotient coordinates, coefficient-list/dual-number comparison;
-- finite vector operations, module scalar actions and explicit normal forms;
-- truncation carriers and the finite chart/refinement interfaces.
-- The source-slope/source-inverse lemmas separate the two derivative comparisons.
